{"version": 1, "title": "Прощай, немытая Россия", "author": "М. Ю. Лермонтов (традиционная атрибуция)", "language": "ru", "canvas": {"width": 941, "height": 1672, "aspectRatio": "9:16", "fit": "cover", "controlsReservedBottom": 0.12}, "palette": {"text": "#F4E8D0", "active": "#FFD99A", "shadow": "rgba(8, 12, 20, 0.48)"}, "scenes": [{"id": "farewell-russia", "image": "01-farewell-russia.png", "lines": 2, "splitLine": 1, "focalPoint": {"x": 0.46, "y": 0.58}, "textPreset": "social-hierarchy-split", "transitionMs": 850, "safeZones": [{"role": "lower", "x": 0.05, "y": 0.6, "width": 0.46, "height": 0.2}, {"role": "upper", "x": 0.4, "y": 0.06, "width": 0.54, "height": 0.24}], "line": "Прощай, немытая Россия, / Страна рабов, страна господ,"}, {"id": "blue-uniforms-and-people", "image": "02-blue-uniforms-and-people.png", "lines": 2, "focalPoint": {"x": 0.5, "y": 0.52}, "textPreset": "uniform-formation", "transitionMs": 760, "safeZones": [{"x": 0.18, "y": 0.06, "width": 0.64, "height": 0.26}], "line": "И вы, мундиры голубые, / И ты, им преданный народ."}, {"id": "caucasus-escape", "image": "03-caucasus-escape.png", "lines": 2, "focalPoint": {"x": 0.5, "y": 0.48}, "textPreset": "ridge-reveal", "transitionMs": 1100, "safeZones": [{"x": 0.08, "y": 0.07, "width": 0.6, "height": 0.26}], "line": "Быть может, за стеной Кавказа / Укроюсь от твоих пашей,"}, {"id": "all-seeing-mountains", "image": "04-all-seeing-mountains.png", "lines": 2, "focalPoint": {"x": 0.5, "y": 0.55}, "textPreset": "searchlight-scan", "transitionMs": 950, "safeZones": [{"x": 0.3, "y": 0.1, "width": 0.62, "height": 0.26}], "line": "От их всевидящего глаза, / От их всеслышащих ушей."}]}